<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Sepap '96 audited CZK 317mln loss.</title>
<headline>Czech Sepap '96 audited CZK 317mln loss.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech paper maker Sepap a.s. said on Wednesday it had posted an audited and consolidated 1996 loss of 317 million crowns versus a 640 million crown net profit in 1995, according to Czech accounting standards  </p>
<p>Results for year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns).</p>
<p>				 1996	vs	 1995</p>
<p> Assets		    8,132.832	    7,531.541</p>
<p> Sales of own products</p>
<p> and services	    5,576.497	    6,645.983</p>
<p> Operating profit	  423.771	    1,246.007</p>
<p> After tax profit	 -316.841(loss)	640.251</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	   -330.174(loss)	981.946</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
